algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: cost functions f, g on {0,...,n-1}
Output: (f * g)(z) = min_x (f(x) + g((z-x) mod n))

for z in {0,...,n-1}:
    result[z] = infinity
    for x in {0,...,n-1}:
        y = (z - x) mod n
        result[z] = min(result[z], f[x] + g[y])
return result

Time: O(n^2), Space: O(n)
